WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:30.625
So far

2
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:34.500
in this chapter, Lord Krishna 
has talked about yoga and renunciation

3
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.916
and explained the qualities

4
00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:38.250
of a superior yogi.

5
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.333
But

6
00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.708
how should yoga be practiced?

7
00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.250
Now from here, Lord Krishna

8
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.458
will begin to shed light

9
00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.000
on the method of Ashtanga Yoga.

10
00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:54.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains

11
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.083
the qualities of a superior yogi

12
00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:59.000
with these two words –

13
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.250
Nirāśī –

14
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.916
meaning one who is free

15
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:04.500
from hopes and expectations.

16
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.458
Aparigrahaħ – meaning

17
00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:10.083
one who doesn't keep a sense of ownership.

18
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:11.458
Neither toward things,

19
00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:13.583
nor toward other people.

20
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:14.750
Krishna says

21
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.541
that to reach this excellence of yoga,

22
00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:20.250
a yogi must focus on their spiritual journey

23
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.625
by living alone

24
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:23.958
in a distant solitude.

25
00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:26.000
If the mind is to be conquered,

26
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.250
concentration is essential.

27
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.416
For which distance must be created

28
00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:31.583
from worldly activities,

29
00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:34.000
daily tasks, and people,

30
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.416
so that there is no distraction in the mind

31
00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:38.791
and one can focus

32
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:41.166
to gain control over the mind.

33
00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:42.458
In such solitude,

34
00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:46.375
the noise of family and 
social entanglements decreases.

35
00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:48.083
A person gets the opportunity

36
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:50.208
to stay away from material cravings.

37
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:54.458
By distancing from everything 
that disturbs attention,

38
00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:59.166
a yogi can now fully focus that attention
on their spirituality.

39
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:02.583
And in such an environment, 
from the experience of infinite peace,

40
00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:06.083
their belief becomes even more firm

41
00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:08.916
that true joy is not amidst cravings,

42
00:02:08.916 --> 00:02:11.000
but in being away from them.

43
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.166
This continuous practice of yoga

44
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:14.291
keeps freeing them

45
00:02:14.291 --> 00:02:17.083
from cravings and expectations.

46
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:19.208
The essence of this verse is that

47
00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:20.875
to reach the highest level

48
00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:22.208
of yoga,

49
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:24.500
a yogi must turn their attention away

50
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.291
from worldly busyness and noise,

51
00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:28.583
concentrate it

52
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:31.375
and focus it within themselves.

53
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:35.333
Only then can they establish
 a connection with God.

54
00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:45.666
Concentration is essential 
for the practice of yoga.

55
00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:48.958
But for this, merely creating

56
00:02:48.958 --> 00:02:51.958
physical distance from the world is not enough.

57
00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:55.791
Many people find a quiet place

58
00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:58.583
where no other sound is heard.

59
00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:02.166
But the noise of worries

60
00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:04.375
and expectations

61
00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:08.125
within the mind still continues.

62
00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:09.750
For yoga,

63
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.916
this inner noise must also be calmed.

64
00:03:13.916 --> 00:03:19.083
Real solitude is not regional solitude,

65
00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:21.416
but internal solitude.

66
00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:24.625
If the mirror of the mind remains covered

67
00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:28.500
with the dust of desires, material attractions,

68
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.750
and worldly worries,

69
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:30.625


70
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:33.791
then neither will your life 
purpose be clearly visible to you,

71
00:03:33.791 --> 00:03:37.583
nor your spiritual truth.

72
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:39.958
This dust must be removed.

73
00:03:39.958 --> 00:03:43.666
But dust that has accumulated 
on the mirror over years

74
00:03:43.666 --> 00:03:47.583
won't be removed by just one day of practice.

75
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:50.666
Time must be allocated.

76
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:54.000
Daily practice of going into solitude

77
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.250
and concentrating must be done.

78
00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.000
Solutions must be found

79
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.708
by reflecting on what difficulty is coming

80
00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:04.375
in concentrating.

81
00:04:04.375 --> 00:04:07.333
For encouragement and guidance,

82
00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:09.250
you can study this Gita

83
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:13.791
and other religious scriptures too.

84
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:17.416
Gradually this dust will start to be removed.

85
00:04:17.416 --> 00:04:21.583
In the mirror of the mind, 
it will start appearing clearly to you

86
00:04:21.583 --> 00:04:25.166
that worldly cravings are futile.

87
00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:28.583
Attachment and aversion are futile.

88
00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:31.916
And what is truly valuable

89
00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:35.083
is your soul.

90
00:04:35.083 --> 00:04:38.625
Which is eager for liberation.

91
00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:42.833
Eager to come and meet me.

92
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:50.666
Family is a small unit

93
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:55.166
where everyone is emotionally connected.

94
00:04:55.166 --> 00:04:57.166
In such a case, it's very natural

95
00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:59.750
that a person starts keeping some expectations

96
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.000
from family members.

97
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.125
Expectation of cooperation and love,

98
00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:06.833
expectation of understanding feelings.

99
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:09.125
But many times,

100
00:05:09.125 --> 00:05:11.833
because of these very expectations,

101
00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:13.458
a person starts trying to exercise authority

102
00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:16.750
and control over family members.

103
00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.458
They want family members to also

104
00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:22.375
behave according to them.

105
00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:25.083
They should also like the same things

106
00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:26.708
that they like.

107
00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:29.791
The principles and people they don't like

108
00:05:29.791 --> 00:05:34.083
shouldn't be liked by family members either.

109
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.291
In a way,

110
00:05:35.291 --> 00:05:39.458
a person starts keeping a 
sense of ownership over others.

111
00:05:39.458 --> 00:05:42.333
But the biggest irony

112
00:05:42.333 --> 00:05:46.125
of such ownership is this:

113
00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:50.875
the one who is the owner is also,
in a way, a slave to that thing.

114
00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:53.375
Understand it like this –

115
00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:56.166
if you keep a sense of complete ownership

116
00:05:56.166 --> 00:05:57.458
over something,

117
00:05:57.458 --> 00:05:58.708
then now

118
00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:02.125
the fear of losing that thing will also haunt you.

119
00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:05.875
If that thing gets damaged, 
you will become restless.

120
00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:07.500
The peace of your mind

121
00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.958
has now become dependent on that thing.

122
00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:13.791
Similarly, a sense of authority 
over family members

123
00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:17.250
will make your peace dependent on them.

124
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:21.083
If others don't act according to you,

125
00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:24.041
the mind will become restless, will be disturbed.

126
00:06:24.041 --> 00:06:26.833
This very thing will create tension.

127
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.125
If you want to remain tension-free,

128
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:31.833
keep your peace independent,

129
00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:35.833
then this sense of authority over family 
members must be renounced.

130
00:06:35.833 --> 00:06:38.458
Remember, everyone has their own life,

131
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:41.625
their own age, their own separate personality.

132
00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:42.791
It's not necessary

133
00:06:42.791 --> 00:06:46.708
that your way is suitable for everyone.

134
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:48.250
Give guidance,

135
00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.458
give suggestions,

136
00:06:49.458 --> 00:06:52.875
but do this in the form of discussion.

137
00:06:52.875 --> 00:06:55.791
Not in the form of authority or command.

138
00:06:55.791 --> 00:06:57.416
Think –

139
00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:00.625
if everyone adopts this thinking,

140
00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:03.291
how much love there will be in the family.

141
00:07:03.291 --> 00:07:05.458
Everyone is connected to each other,

142
00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:07.791
helps each other,

143
00:07:07.791 --> 00:07:11.458
wishes well for each other, but at the same time

144
00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:15.791
also respects each other's independence.

145
00:07:15.791 --> 00:07:17.958
This is the foundation

146
00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:20.625
of a loving family.

147
00:07:25.041 --> 00:07:27.000
A yogi

148
00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.708
over any thing or person.

149
00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:32.166
doesn't keep a sense of authority

150
00:07:32.166 --> 00:07:36.166
And this is the secret of their peace.

151
00:07:36.166 --> 00:07:39.291
And in professional life,

152
00:07:39.291 --> 00:07:43.375
this very sense of authority 
is the cause of most difficulties.

153
00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:45.416
Because of this, people

154
00:07:45.416 --> 00:07:47.583
experience stress nowadays.

155
00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:50.791
What is this sense of authority?

156
00:07:50.791 --> 00:07:52.791
For example,

157
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:54.500
authority over position.

158
00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.666
"I am the owner of this position."

159
00:07:57.666 --> 00:08:00.333
Or authority over people.

160
00:08:00.333 --> 00:08:02.625
"These people must respect me,

161
00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:05.000
must follow my orders."

162
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.583
Or authority over knowledge.

163
00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:08.875
"This knowledge is mine,

164
00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:12.875
why should I share it with anyone else?"

165
00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:15.166
A foolish person

166
00:08:15.166 --> 00:08:16.583
starts considering authority over who knows

167
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:19.583
how many such things.

168
00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:22.291
Whereas none of these is theirs,

169
00:08:22.291 --> 00:08:25.916
nor will all this last long.

170
00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:28.958
And this very thing gives birth to tension.

171
00:08:28.958 --> 00:08:31.708
Becomes an obstacle in development.

172
00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:35.000
If the position doesn't remain, 
the person becomes sad.

173
00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:38.541
If people don't respect, they struggle.

174
00:08:38.541 --> 00:08:40.791
If they don't share knowledge with others,

175
00:08:40.791 --> 00:08:44.875
then people also don't help in times of difficulty.

176
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:48.500
How futile is all this.

177
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.041
Position, people, knowledge –

178
00:08:50.041 --> 00:08:54.541
you don't have permanent
 authority over any of these.

179
00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:57.625
All this was given to you

180
00:08:57.625 --> 00:09:00.833
only for the convenience of doing your work.

181
00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:03.291
Remove this sense of authority

182
00:09:03.291 --> 00:09:06.500
and focus attention only on your work.

183
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.500
The position was given for doing work,

184
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.083
not for ego.

185
00:09:10.083 --> 00:09:11.875
Give respect to people,

186
00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:13.583
you'll automatically receive respect.

187
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:15.750
Share your knowledge with others,

188
00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:19.375
then at the right time they will also help you.

189
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:22.958
This is the right path of progress.

190
00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:25.333
Where no one shows ego,

191
00:09:25.333 --> 00:09:28.500
but helps each other.

192
00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:33.375
Only then will the organization's 
and your progress happen.
